# sol_earth.layout — Earth city surface
# Auto-generated from load_planet('earth') — 60x40
#
# Buildings: spaceport (NW), bar+ bounties (NE),
#            merchants (SW), militia (SE)
#
# NOTE: Building labels (spaceport, bar, bounties, merchants,
# militia) are shown as readable text in the MAP below.  They
# are dynamically-created label tiles (kind='label') — the
# parser does not yet map these to Tile constants.  Labels
# will need either LABEL: directives or a passthrough-glyph
# convention before this layout is machine-parseable.
#
# Entity markers (trade terminal, mech terminal, armory,
# showroom ships, guild NPCs) are not yet representable in
# the layout format and will need ENTITY: directives.
#

